00:00:33,338 --> 00:00:34,673
AND JADE PLAYED THE BLAME GAME

15
00:00:34,673 --> 00:00:36,341
IN FRONT OF THE JUDGES.

16
00:00:36,341 --> 00:00:38,009
YOU GUYS USED MY WORST ONE.

17
00:00:38,009 --> 00:00:39,444
JADE'S ATTITUDE
KNOCKED HER DOWN

18
00:00:39,444 --> 00:00:40,679
TO THE BOTTOM TWO.

19
00:00:40,679 --> 00:00:42,180
JADE, YOU DON'T KNOW IT ALL.

20
00:00:42,180 --> 00:00:43,548
BUT IN THE END,
IT WAS MOLLIE SUE

21
00:00:43,548 --> 00:00:45,150
WHO WAS SENT HOME.

22
00:00:45,150 --> 00:00:46,585
EIGHT GIRLS REMAIN.

23
00:00:46,585 --> 00:00:48,453
WHO WILL BE ELIMINATED TONIGHT?

24
00:00:48,453 --> 00:00:50,689
♪♪♪

25
00:01:34,933 --> 00:01:36,768
LIKE, I FEEL LIKE
I CAME TO THIS GAME

26
00:01:36,768 --> 00:01:38,670
