GET THE BEST OUT OF IT.

27
00:01:44,976 --> 00:01:46,311
THEY...

28
00:01:46,311 --> 00:01:47,979
I WAS AT THE BOTTOM TWO...

29
00:01:47,979 --> 00:01:49,347
AGAIN.

30
00:01:49,347 --> 00:01:52,717
JADE, YOU STAND BEFORE ME
