THROUGHOUT THE TECHNIQUE.

141
00:06:21,451 --> 00:06:22,752
SWIRL, SWIRL, SWIRL.

142
00:06:22,752 --> 00:06:24,788
SWIRL, SWIRL.

143
00:06:24,788 --> 00:06:26,823
NOPE, NOPE, NOT LIKE THAT.

