170
00:07:17,440 --> 00:07:19,542
THE WHOLE ROOM--ATWIRL.

171
00:07:19,542 --> 00:07:20,777
SWIRL.

172
00:07:20,777 --> 00:07:21,945
HOW BEAUTIFUL.

173
00:07:21,945 --> 00:07:25,582
WHEN YOU GO
