FEED OFF IT.

710
00:25:03,739 --> 00:25:04,740
GO WITH IT.

711
00:25:04,740 --> 00:25:05,741
THIS IS BROOKE, Y'ALL.

712
00:25:05,741 --> 00:25:06,742
HEY, BROOKE!

713
00:25:06,742 --> 00:25:08,410
YO, CAN I GET, "BROOKE"?

714
00:25:08,410 --> 00:25:10,212
BROOKE!

715
00:25:10,212 --> 00:25:12,781
OH, YOU HAVE GREAT LEGS.

716
00:25:12,781 --> 00:25:14,049
THERE YOU GO.

717
00:25:14,049 --> 00:25:16,285
THERE YOU GO!

718
00:25:16,285 --> 00:25:17,686
TURN IT FLAT TO THE CAMERA

719
00:25:17,686 --> 00:25:18,720
SO I SEE THE DETAIL
ON THE SHOES.

720
00:25:18,720 --> 00:25:20,155
BROOKE HAS A KILLER BODY,

721
00:25:20,155 --> 00:25:23,292
BUT I THINK SHE WENT OFF
INTO THOSE STRIPPER POSES.

722
00:25:23,292 --> 00:25:25,127
♪♪♪

723
00:25:25,127 --> 00:25:26,395
BE HAPPY ABOUT YOUR SHOES.

724
00:25:26,395 --> 00:25:28,197
THERE, YOU'RE HAPPY ABOUT
THOSE PAYLESS SHOES.

725
00:25:28,197 --> 00:25:29,832
TEN FRAMES, GUYS.

726
00:25:29,832 --> 00:25:31,066
LET'S GET HER
A BOTTLE OF WATER.

727
00:25:31,066 --> 00:25:33,402
♪♪♪

728
00:25:33,402 --> 00:25:34,670
I WON THE CHALLENGE
OF THE DAY,

729
00:25:34,670 --> 00:25:35,904
AND MY SPIRITS ARE UP.

730
00:25:35,904 --> 00:25:37,773
I FEEL SO GOOD,
BECAUSE THIS IS, LIKE,

731
00:25:37,773 --> 00:25:39,741
MY GEN-DRE OF A PHOTO SHOOT.

732
00:25:39,741 --> 00:25:40,742
THERE YOU GO.

733
00:25:40,742 --> 00:25:42,010
GO, JADE!

734
00:25:42,010 --> 00:25:43,178
THERE YOU GO!

735
00:25:43,178 --> 00:25:44,313
HEY!

736
00:25:44,313 --> 00:25:45,881
WHOO!

737
00:25:45,881 --> 00:25:47,316
IT'S GREAT,
IT'S GREAT ENERGY.

738
00:25:47,316 --> 00:25:48,283
JUST SLOW IT DOWN
JUST A LITTLE BIT.

739
00:25:48,283 --> 00:25:49,985
COME EVEN CLOSER.

740
00:25:49,985 --> 00:25:53,188
THIS IS THE FIRST DAY
YOU ACTUALLY HAVE IMPRESSED ME.

741
00:25:53,188 --> 00:25:54,189
LOOK AT ME.

742
00:25:54,189 --> 00:25:55,224
I AM A SUPERMODEL.

743
00:25:55,224 --> 00:25:56,758
DO YOU SEE THE POTENTIAL?

744
00:25:56,758 --> 00:25:57,793
DO YOU SEE IT?

745
00:25:57,793 --> 00:25:59,161
THERE YOU GO.

746
00:25:59,161 --> 00:26:00,696
WHOO!

747
00:26:00,696 --> 00:26:02,231
OH, OH, OH, OH, OH!

748
00:26:02,231 --> 00:26:03,432
WHOO!

749
00:26:03,432 --> 00:26:04,933
- MOVE IT, JADE!
- THERE YOU GO!

750
00:26:04,933 --> 00:26:06,902
JADE PICKED UP
THE WATER BOTTLE AT THE END,

751
00:26:06,902 --> 00:26:09,171
THREW THE WATER
OFF HER CHEST, AND PSHHH!

752
00:26:09,171 --> 00:26:11,874
IT WAS SO CLASSIC TYRA,
DOING SOMETHING LIKE THAT

753
00:26:11,874 --> 00:26:13,308
JUST TO MAKE THE SHOT
EXTRA-SPECIAL.

754
00:26:13,308 --> 00:26:15,444
♪♪♪

755
00:26:15,444 --> 00:26:16,845
♪ JOANIE AND DANIELLE ♪

756
00:26:16,845 --> 00:26:17,980
♪ GO WAY BACK ♪

757
00:26:17,980 --> 00:26:19,715
♪ I LOOK GREAT AND I SHINE ♪

758
00:26:19,715 --> 00:26:21,316
♪ ON "TOP MODEL" ♪

759
00:26:21,316 --> 00:26:23,185
♪ YOU WANNA BE LIKE ME? ♪

760
00:26:23,185 --> 00:26:24,253
♪ ME AND JOANIE ♪

761
00:26:24,253 --> 00:26:25,520
♪ DO IT SO TOUGH ♪

762
00:26:25,520 --> 00:26:27,022
TYRA MAIL!

763
00:26:27,022 --> 00:26:28,023
♪ I'M SO TOUGH ♪

764
00:26:28,023 --> 00:26:30,058
♪ I'M-A PASS MY FLOW TO JO-JO ♪

765
00:26:30,058 --> 00:26:31,260
(laughs)

766
00:26:31,260 --> 00:26:32,761
"TOMORROW YOU WILL MEET
WITH THE JUDGES.

767
00:26:32,761 --> 00:26:35,163
ONLY SEVEN WILL CONTINUE ON
IN THE HOPES OF BECOMING

768
00:26:35,163 --> 00:26:37,766
AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL."

769
00:26:37,766 --> 00:26:38,567
I'M A LITTLE BIT NERVOUS.

770
00:26:38,567 --> 00:26:39,768
I DON'T KNOW.

771
00:26:39,768 --> 00:26:41,136
I MEAN, THERE'S JUST
NOT A WHOLE LOT

772
00:26:41,136 --> 00:26:42,337
I CAN DO ABOUT IT
AT THIS POINT,

773
00:26:42,337 --> 00:26:44,339
SO I'M JUST TRYING
TO STAY CALM AND...

774
00:26:44,339 --> 00:26:46,642
♪♪♪

775
00:26:46,642 --> 00:26:47,676
EXCUSE ME, NNENNA.

776
00:26:47,676 --> 00:26:50,178
I LET MY NERVES
GET THE BETTER OF ME,

777
00:26:50,178 --> 00:26:52,681
AND I KINDA WANNA
PROVE TO TYRA

778
00:26:52,681 --> 00:26:55,150
THAT I CAN BE A MODEL.

779
00:26:55,150 --> 00:26:57,452
I'M WONDERING HOW, LIKE,
SARA DID, YOU KNOW?

780
00:26:57,452 --> 00:27:00,155
'CAUSE SHE'S REALLY TALL
AND THEY'RE ALL SO SHORT.

781
00:27:00,155 --> 00:27:02,557
I'M WONDERING HOW THAT LOOKED.

782
00:27:02,557 --> 00:27:04,559
I'M NOT REALLY CONFIDENT
ABOUT MY PHOTO SHOOT.

783
00:27:04,559 --> 00:27:06,295
I THINK I COULD'VE
DONE A LOT BETTER,

784
00:27:06,295 --> 00:27:07,796
AND I'M THINKING
THAT IT'S PROBABLY ME

785
00:27:07,796 --> 00:27:09,164
THAT'S GONNA GO HOME.

786
00:27:09,164 --> 00:27:10,232
♪♪♪

787
00:27:13,791 --> 00:27:18,551
♪♪♪

788
00:27:21,673 --> 00:27:22,908
HELLO, EVERYBODY.

789
00:27:22,908 --> 00:27:24,810
YOU LOOK VERY NICE.

790
00:27:24,810 --> 00:27:26,678
BUT TODAY IT'S TIME
TO MAKE ANOTHER CUT.

791
00:27:26,678 --> 00:27:29,281
ONE OF YOU WILL BE GOING HOME.

792
00:27:29,281 --> 00:27:30,782
LET ME TALK ABOUT THESE PRIZES.

793
00:27:30,782 --> 00:27:34,219
THE FIRST IS A CONTRACT
WITH TOP INTERNATIONAL

794
00:27:34,219 --> 00:27:37,222
MODELING MANAGEMENT COMPANY
FORD MODELS,

795
00:27:37,222 --> 00:27:39,424
A SPREAD IN "ELLE" MAGAZINE
WHICH WILL BE SHOT

796
00:27:39,424 --> 00:27:42,628
BY A WORLD-RENOWNED
PHOTOGRAPHER, GILLES BENSIMON,

797
00:27:42,628 --> 00:27:47,332
AND A $100,000 CONTRACT
FROM COVERGIRL COSMETICS.

798
00:27:47,332 --> 00:27:48,600
AND, OF COURSE,
WE KNOW THE JUDGES.

799
00:27:48,600 --> 00:27:51,303
THE FIRST IS MR.
NIGEL BARKER,

800
00:27:51,303 --> 00:27:52,738
NOTED FASHION PHOTOGRAPHER...

801
00:27:52,738 --> 00:27:54,640
MISS J. ALEXANDER,

802
00:27:54,640 --> 00:27:57,242
AND, OF COURSE,
HE IS YOUR RUNWAY COACH.

803
00:27:57,242 --> 00:27:59,711
AND FASHION ICON TWIGGY.

804
00:27:59,711 --> 00:28:01,413
HELLO, YOU ALL
LOOK GORGEOUS.

805
00:28:01,413 --> 00:28:04,216
AND ROY CAMPBELL
IS A FASHION JOURNALIST

806
00:28:04,216 --> 00:28:06,618
AND CELEBRITY FASHION EVENT
PRODUCER.

807
00:28:06,618 --> 00:28:08,754
I'VE KNOWN ROY
SINCE I WAS 17 YEARS OLD.

808
00:28:08,754 --> 00:28:10,689
- THAT'S RIGHT.
- BACK IN THE DAY IN PARIS,

809
00:28:10,689 --> 00:28:12,591
AND I THINK HE WROTE
THE VERY FIRST ARTICLE

810
00:28:12,591 --> 00:28:14,593
ABOUT ME IN FASHION.

811
00:28:14,593 --> 00:28:16,195
ALL RIGHTY,
SO THIS WEEK YOU LEARNED

812
00:28:16,195 --> 00:28:19,831
HOW IMPORTANT IT IS FOR A MODEL
TO KNOW HOW TO MOVE.

813
00:28:19,831 --> 00:28:22,334
YOU HAD A SOULFUL WEEK
WORKING WITH MISS J.,

814
00:28:22,334 --> 00:28:25,504
THE TWINS, AND DOING
A CHURCH RUNWAY FASHION SHOW.

815
00:28:25,504 --> 00:28:28,407
THAT'S THE VERY FIRST
FASHION SHOW THAT I EVER SAW.

816
00:28:28,407 --> 00:28:30,242
AND I WAS LIKE,
"WOW, THIS IS THEATRICAL.

817
00:28:30,242 --> 00:28:31,443
THIS IS AMAZING."

818
00:28:31,443 --> 00:28:33,278
(cheers and applause)
SO WHEN PEOPLE SEE ME

819
00:28:33,278 --> 00:28:34,813
DOING ALL THAT
AND KINDA SASHAYING

820
00:28:34,813 --> 00:28:36,615
AND LOOKING
TO THE LEFT AND THE RIGHT...

821
00:28:36,615 --> 00:28:40,652
I WAS USING LITTLE BITS OF THAT,
AND I MADE IT MY OWN.

822
00:28:40,652 --> 00:28:43,822
SO TODAY YOU'RE GONNA TAKE
THE CHURCH FASHION SHOW WALK

823
00:28:43,822 --> 00:28:46,325
BUT INCORPORATE IT INTO YOU.

824
00:28:46,325 --> 00:28:48,193
IF YOU'RE
WALKING IN SILHOUETTE,

825
00:28:48,193 --> 00:28:49,861
THE RUNWAY IS PITCH-BLACK
AND YOU'RE WALKING DOWN

826
00:28:49,861 --> 00:28:51,196
THAT RUNWAY, THEY KNOW.

827
00:28:51,196 --> 00:28:52,698
"OOH, THAT'S HER,
I CAN TELL.

828
00:28:52,698 --> 00:28:55,601
BECAUSE THAT'S A SIGNATURE WALK
AND IT MAKES HER SPECIAL."

829
00:28:55,601 --> 00:28:57,436
BUT THERE'S A LITTLE ADDED TWIST
TO THIS--

830
00:28:57,436 --> 00:28:59,471
THIS IS WHAT I WANT YOU TO DO...

831
00:28:59,471 --> 00:29:00,739
ALL RIGHTY.

832
00:29:00,739 --> 00:29:03,675
SIGNATURE WALK, SIGNATURE
WALK, SIGNATURE WALK.

833
00:29:03,675 --> 00:29:05,877
♪♪♪

834
00:29:05,877 --> 00:29:07,546
THAT'S MY SIGNATURE WALK.

835
00:29:07,546 --> 00:29:09,648
THEN I WANT YOU
TO GET BACK HERE,

836
00:29:09,648 --> 00:29:11,950
HIT THIS,
AND...

837
00:29:11,950 --> 00:29:17,222
TURN,
AS IF YOU ARE ON A TURNTABLE.

838
00:29:17,222 --> 00:29:18,824
DO YOU SEE HOW SMOOTH THAT IS?

839
00:29:18,824 --> 00:29:20,125
BRILLIANT!

840
00:29:20,125 --> 00:29:21,326
(chuckles)
(applause)

841
00:29:21,326 --> 00:29:23,161
SO WHAT I'M CHECKING FOR
IS YOUR POSTURE

842
00:29:23,161 --> 00:29:24,529
AND YOUR BALANCE.

843
00:29:24,529 --> 00:29:26,531
ALL RIGHTY,
LET'S GET STARTED.

844
00:29:26,531 --> 00:29:27,866
MISS JADE, YOU'RE FIRST TODAY.

845
00:29:27,866 --> 00:29:30,702
♪♪♪

846
00:31:04,196 --> 00:31:05,197
THANKS, SARA.

847
00:31:05,197 --> 00:31:07,733
♪♪♪

848
00:31:11,403 --> 00:31:13,805
SO NOW IT'S TIME
FOR YOUR INDIVIDUAL EVALUATIONS.

849
00:31:13,805 --> 00:31:16,675
FIRST IS JADE.

850
00:31:16,675 --> 00:31:18,210
YOU WERE A BIT STUCK
ON THE TURN.

851
00:31:18,210 --> 00:31:21,213
YOU MANAGED, BUT YOU WERE A
LITTLE BIT STUCK,

852
00:31:21,213 --> 00:31:22,280
LIKE YOU WERE TURNING IN GRAVEL.

853
00:31:22,280 --> 00:31:23,648
I THOUGHT IT WAS A GOOD WALK.

854
00:31:23,648 --> 00:31:25,550
BUT A GREAT WALK
WOULD BE YOU GIVING

855
00:31:25,550 --> 00:31:28,220
A LITTLE BIT MORE POWER,
'CAUSE YOU'RE JUST LIKE THIS.

856
00:31:28,220 --> 00:31:29,821
I WANNA SEE...
(exhales deeply)

857
00:31:29,821 --> 00:31:31,356
ALTHOUGH,
AT THE CHURCH FASHION SHOW,

858
00:31:31,356 --> 00:31:33,125
YOU WON THE CHALLENGE,
MISS JADE.

859
00:31:33,125 --> 00:31:34,593
(applause)

860
00:31:34,593 --> 00:31:39,898
SO YOU HAD A PHOTO SHOOT
WHERE YOU HAD TO KRUMP.

861
00:31:39,898 --> 00:31:41,366
DOES EVERYBODY KNOW
WHAT KRUMPING IS?

862
00:31:41,366 --> 00:31:42,601
- TWIGGY?
- I DON'T.

863
00:31:42,601 --> 00:31:44,703
WELL, KRUMPING IS--
IT'S A NEW TYPE OF DANCING

864
00:31:44,703 --> 00:31:46,171
THAT'S TAKING OVER BY STORM.

865
00:31:46,171 --> 00:31:47,172
IT'S JUST CRAZY MOVEMENT.

866
00:31:47,172 --> 00:31:48,440
ALL RIGHT, LET'S DO IT.

867
00:31:48,440 --> 00:31:50,575
♪ GO, TYRA ♪
♪ GO, TYRA ♪

868
00:31:50,575 --> 00:31:51,810
♪ GO, TYRA ♪
♪ GO, TYRA ♪

869
00:31:51,810 --> 00:31:53,512
♪ GO, TYRA ♪
♪ GO, TYRA ♪

870
00:31:53,512 --> 00:31:55,380
♪ GO, J. ♪
♪ GO, J. ♪

871
00:31:55,380 --> 00:31:56,748
♪ GO, TYRA ♪
♪ GO, TYRA ♪

872
00:31:56,748 --> 00:31:58,583
(laughing)

873
00:31:58,583 --> 00:31:59,651
KRUMPING!

874
00:31:59,651 --> 00:32:01,553
- NOW, MISS TWIGGY...
- NOT REALLY!

875
00:32:01,553 --> 00:32:03,555
I-I'M GONNA STICK
TO TAP DANCING, THANK YOU.

876
00:32:03,555 --> 00:32:04,823
(laughs)

877
00:32:04,823 --> 00:32:06,258
JADE, HERE IS YOUR BEST SHOT.

878
00:32:06,258 --> 00:32:08,727
♪♪♪

879
00:32:08,727 --> 00:32:09,961
SHE DOESN'T LOOK LIKE
SHE'S KRUMPING TO ME.

880
00:32:09,961 --> 00:32:11,196
SHE LOOKS LIKE SHE'S HUMPING.

881
00:32:11,196 --> 00:32:12,330
YOU KNOW WHAT,
I'M LOOKING AT YOU,

882
00:32:12,330 --> 00:32:13,598
DESPITE THE CLOWN
IN THE BACKGROUND.

883
00:32:13,598 --> 00:32:15,200
BUT YOU DID FORGET
YOU WERE MODELING.

884
00:32:15,200 --> 00:32:17,536
YOUR FACE WAS STRONG,
BUT YOU HAD ALL THIS, "UH, UH!"

885
00:32:17,536 --> 00:32:19,671
BUT YOU WERE LIKE,
"OH! AH! UH! OH!"

886
00:32:19,671 --> 00:32:21,740
EVERYTHING WAS GREAT
EXCEPT THIS.

887
00:32:21,740 --> 00:32:23,241
NEXT IS SARA.

888
00:32:23,241 --> 00:32:25,610
YOU'RE LIKE A TANK
COMING DOWN THAT RUNWAY AT US.

889
00:32:25,610 --> 00:32:27,312
BAM, BAM, BAM, BAM, BAM!

890
00:32:27,312 --> 00:32:30,215
ALL RIGHTY, SARA,
HERE IS YOUR BEST SHOT.

891
00:32:30,215 --> 00:32:31,516
QUITE INTERESTING, ACTUALLY.

892
00:32:31,516 --> 00:32:33,251
I DON'T KNOW WHETHER IT'S--
IS THAT "KLUMPING"?

893
00:32:33,251 --> 00:32:34,252
KRUMPING.

894
00:32:34,252 --> 00:32:36,254
KRUMPING!
(laughs)

895
00:32:36,254 --> 00:32:37,522
I MEAN, AT THE BAT OF AN EYE,

896
00:32:37,522 --> 00:32:38,723
IT LOOKED LIKE YOU'RE SLIPPING
ON A BANANA PEEL.

897
00:32:38,723 --> 00:32:40,292
I WAS TRYING
TO SHOW OFF THE SHOES.

898
00:32:40,292 --> 00:32:42,194
IT WAS SUPPOSED TO BE
SHOWING OFF PAYLESS SHOES.

899
00:32:42,194 --> 00:32:43,328
IT'S DEFINITELY
A SHOE SHOT, TOO.

900
00:32:43,328 --> 00:32:44,596
EXACTLY--I MEAN,
THIS CAN'T BE

901
00:32:44,596 --> 00:32:46,465
ABOUT NAILING
KRUMPING PROPERLY.

902
00:32:46,465 --> 00:32:47,833
IT'S GOTTA BE ABOUT
PRODUCING A GREAT SHOT.

903
00:32:47,833 --> 00:32:49,234
YOU HAVE TO REMEMBER,

904
00:32:49,234 --> 00:32:51,136
THIS IS THE MONEY RIGHT HERE.

905
00:32:51,136 --> 00:32:53,438
UP NEXT IS FURONDA.

906
00:32:53,438 --> 00:32:54,840
FURONDA--GUYS, YOU
THINK I COULD TAKE HER

907
00:32:54,840 --> 00:32:56,875
TO THE DOCTOR
AND BREAK HER RIGHT ARM?

908
00:32:56,875 --> 00:32:58,343
THAT'S PARALYZED?

909
00:32:58,343 --> 00:32:59,377
I'VE GOTTA SAY THAT
YOU DO HAVE

910
00:32:59,377 --> 00:33:00,512
- A SIGNATURE WALK.
- I AGREE.

911
00:33:00,512 --> 00:33:01,646
WHETHER ONE LIKES IT OR NOT,

912
00:33:01,646 --> 00:33:03,415
- IT IS A SIGNATURE.
- I AGREE.

913
00:33:03,415 --> 00:33:06,117
SO YOU HAD A PHOTO SHOOT,
AND HERE IS YOUR BEST SHOT.

914
00:33:06,117 --> 00:33:07,419
WOW.

915
00:33:07,419 --> 00:33:08,620
THE FACE IS SLAMMING.

916
00:33:08,620 --> 00:33:10,388
AND YOU'RE REALLY CONNECTING
WITH THE CAMERA,

917
00:33:10,388 --> 00:33:11,389
SO WELL DONE.

918
00:33:11,389 --> 00:33:12,390
ALL RIGHT, FURONDA.

919
00:33:12,390 --> 00:33:14,893
NEXT IS BROOKE.

920
00:33:14,893 --> 00:33:16,528
BROOKE, I LOVE YOU, BUT

921
00:33:16,528 --> 00:33:17,829
THAT WAS JUST
A DREADFUL WALK.

922
00:33:17,829 --> 00:33:18,830
I TOTALLY DISAGREE.

923
00:33:18,830 --> 00:33:19,831
UM, I LOVED YOUR WALK.

924
00:33:19,831 --> 00:33:20,832
I THOUGHT IT WAS SEXY.

925
00:33:20,832 --> 00:33:22,167
I THOUGHT IT WAS CHIC.

926
00:33:22,167 --> 00:33:24,903
ALL RIGHTY, BROOKE,
HERE IS YOUR BEST SHOT.

927
00:33:24,903 --> 00:33:26,538
I LIKE THE FACE.
(chuckles)

928
00:33:26,538 --> 00:33:30,208
THE FACE LOOKS LIKE
YOUR NAME IS "LaBROOKE."

929
00:33:30,208 --> 00:33:33,378
IT--IT'S VERY ETHNIC AND SEXY.

930
00:33:33,378 --> 00:33:34,846
IT'S A VERY DIFFERENT LOOK
FOR YOU.

931
00:33:34,846 --> 00:33:36,414
IT'S VERY RAUNCHY.

932
00:33:36,414 --> 00:33:38,316
(laughter)
I LIKE IT, IT'S GOOD.

933
00:33:38,316 --> 00:33:39,584
BROOKE,
THIS IS THE REAL DEAL.

934
00:33:39,584 --> 00:33:40,785
THAT FIERCENESS...

935
00:33:40,785 --> 00:33:42,153
THEN I THINK YOU WOULD OWN IT.

936
00:33:42,153 --> 00:33:44,389
THEN IT WOULD BE A SIGNATURE
ON THE RUNWAY.

937
00:33:44,389 --> 00:33:46,791
THERE'S NOTHING SIGNATURE
ABOUT CONFUSION.

938
00:33:46,791 --> 00:33:49,361
NEXT UP IS JOANIE.

939
00:33:49,361 --> 00:33:50,595
YOU TOTALLY DID IT.

940
00:33:50,595 --> 00:33:53,398
THAT WALK THAT YOU HAD TODAY
WAS SO SOULFUL,

941
00:33:53,398 --> 00:33:55,133
BUT AT THE
SAME TIME IT WAS YOU.

942
00:33:55,133 --> 00:33:56,535
AND I SAW SOME SIGNATURE.

943
00:33:56,535 --> 00:33:58,336
ALL RIGHT, JOANIE,
WELL, YOU HAD A PHOTO SHOOT

944
