I TRIED TO GIVE THEM
MY ALL, BUT...

1188
00:42:08,960 --> 00:42:10,328
(sniffles)
I GUESS, YOU KNOW,

1189
00:42:10,328 --> 00:42:12,163
I JUST--FEELING THAT
MAYBE I WASN'T GOOD ENOUGH.

1190
00:42:12,163 --> 00:42:14,165
THAT'S WHAT IS--
THAT'S WHAT'S DISAPPOINTING.

1191
